# cb-line.inv — cull any candidate lacking a `cb <N>;` budget line.
#
# Mirrors auto-evolve-ab.sh validity check 3c: a raw-text `^\s*cb\s+[0-9]+\s*;`
# match at the top of the source. Source-shape field `has_cb_line` (payload
# v2, agentis-core #938) is that raw-text match. A boolean field takes a bare
# boolean literal and only ==/!=.
class = inviolable
when has_cb_line == false
